      "title_zh": "和爸爸去北京",
      "title_en": "To Beijing with Dad",
      "paragraphs": [
        ["去年", "，", "我", "和", "爸爸", "坐", "车", "去", "北京", "玩", "。"],
        ["北京", "非常", "热", "！", "我们", "喝", "了", "很", "多", "水", "。"],
        ["我们", "去", "了", "很", "多", "地方", "。", "爸爸", "走", "路", "很", "快", "，", "我", "跟", "不", "上", "他", "。"],
        ["晚上", "，", "我们", "在", "一", "个", "小", "地方", "吃", "东西", "。", "我们", "吃", "了", "很", "多", "。", "那里", "的", "人", "都", "很", "好", "。"],
        ["他", "说", "：", "“", "下", "次", "我们", "再", "来", "吧", "！", "”", "我", "说", "：", "“", "好", "！", "我", "还", "想", "来", "！", "”"]
      ],
      "translations": [
        "Last year Dad and I went to Beijing for fun.",
        "Beijing was really hot! We drank lots of water.",
        "We went to lots of places. Dad walks really fast — I couldn’t keep up with him.",
        "In the evening we ate at a little place. We ate loads. The people there were all really nice.",
        "He said: “Let’s come again next time!” I said: “Yes! I want to come back!”"
      ],
      "names": ["北京"],
      "new_words": ["去年", "爸爸", "热"],
